WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.800
Slow convection currents in the mantle carry the plates.

2
00:00:04.751 --> 00:00:08.276
Heat from the core warms the mantle rock at the bottom.

3
00:00:09.254 --> 00:00:13.779
Warm rock is less dense and rises; it cools at the top and sinks.

4
00:00:14.604 --> 00:00:18.904
The current drags the plates with it, apart above the rising rock.
